wayexpand (1.0.0-1) focal; urgency=medium

  * Release v1.0.0: Production-ready with stability guarantees
  * Add stability guarantees for CLI exit codes, JSON outputs, config schema
  * Complete security audit against threat model (no vulnerabilities found)
  * Comprehensive documentation: COMPATIBILITY.md, SECURITY_AUDIT.md, roadmaps
  * Known limitations documented with clear 1.1 roadmap
  * Build system hardened: vendored dependencies, fixed CI on GitHub and Launchpad
  * Verified new crates (backend-clipboard, backend-kwin-window)

