wayexpand (0.2.0-1) focal; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.2.0: evdev backend, GUI redesign, character-drop fix
  * Add experimental evdev capture backend for KWin/KDE Plasma support
  * Refresh GUI with theme system, custom snippet rows, dark/light modes
  * Fix character dropping in keysym synthesis with per-character pacing
  * Add ei_keyboard fallback for EIS servers without ei_text interface
  * Fix systemd user service startup failures (218/CAPABILITIES)
  * Replace unavailable emoji with font-verified alternatives

